            "name": "description",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "Unattended systems are susceptible to unauthorized use and must be locked. Configuring a system to lock when a smart card is removed will ensure the system is inaccessible when unattended."
